\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHAPartitionFence.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteBeforeFenceDelivered = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    PromotionRequiresDeliveredFence
    NoSplitBrainWritable
    NoOldPrimaryWritesAfterPromotion
    Safety

==== BadOldPrimaryWriteAfterPromotion
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyHAPartitionFence.tla.
\* Reuses the promote-before-fence-delivery mutant, pinned to the write-level
\* invariant: the still-unfenced old primary appends via its NORMAL write path
\* after promotion.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteBeforeFenceDelivered = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoOldPrimaryWritesAfterPromotion

==== BadPromoteBeforeFence
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyHAPartitionFence.tla.
\* Promotion is allowed while the old primary is partitioned from fence delivery.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyPromoteBeforeFenceDelivered = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    PromotionRequiresDeliveredFence
    NoSplitBrainWritable
